The entry's Previous/Next links still have a Budapest date offset: on September 25, Previous points to September 23 and Next points back to September 25. The calendar's direct route worked; adjacent-day navigation is not demonstrated here. These are source-run stills, not a hosted multi-user app or a finished release film. Paired screen recordings, Cartesia narration, Remotion animation, timed captions, annotations, and a final poster remain open.
